    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ezira naasomera abantu Ebiragiro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu boona bakeesorooza hamu omu kizigati ekinyakuli omu irembo ly'amaizi; baagambira Ezira omuhandiiki aleete ekitabu eky'ebiragiro bya Musa, MUKAMA ebi akaba ateeriireho Abaisirairi ha kiro eky'okubanza eky'okwezi kwa musanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezira yakireeta omumaiso g'ekitebe eky'abasaija n'abakazi abakaba nibasobora kuhurra n'okwetegereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakisoma aroleriire ekizigati ekinyakuli omumaiso g'irembo ery'amaizi, akakisoma okuruga nyenkya okuhika omu ihangwe, omu maiso g'abasaija n'abakazi, n'abo abakaba nibasobora kwetegereza; n'abo abakaba bataireho omutima okuhurra ekitabu ky'ebiragiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezira omuhandiiki akeemerra ha kituuti ekikaba kikoliirwe kwemererwaho; haihi na uwe ha mukono gwe ogw'obulyo, hakeemerraho Matisiya, Seema, Anaya, Uliya, Hirikiya na Maaseya; kandi ha mukono gwe ogw'obumoso, haayemerraho Pedaaya, Misairi, Malikiya, Hasumu, Hasibadana, Zekaliya na Mesulaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezira yasuukura ekitabu abantu boona bamuhangire amaiso; habwokuba akaba ali haiguru y'abantu boona; kandi obu yakisuukwire, boona baayemerra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezira akahaisaniza MUKAMA, Ruhanga ow'ekitiinisa; abantu boona baimukya emikono baagarukamu bati: “Kisemeriire, kisemeriire”, bainama, baaramya MUKAMA, obuso bwabo nibuhikira kimu ha itaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Yeswa, Bbaani, Serebiya, Yamiini, Akubbu, Sabetayi, Hodiya, Maaseya, Kelita, Azaliya, Yozabbaadi, Hanani, Pelaya, Abaleevi, bakakonyera abantu okwetegereza ebiragiro, batakarugire omu biikaro byabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakahindura kurungi Ebiragiro bya Ruhanga, baabisoborra, abantu baabikenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nehemiya ow'akaba ali mulemi omukuru, Ezira nyakatagara kandi omuhandiiki, n'Abaleevi abaayegesaaga abantu, bakabagambira bati: “Ekiro kinu kikuru kandi ky'ekitiinisa, hali MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu.” Habwokuba abantu boona obu bahuliire ebigambo balizire ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hanyuma yabagambira ati: “Irooko mugende, mweriire ebintu eby'ebisajwa, mwenywere eviini empotole kandi ogu ataina eki ateekaniriziibwe, mumutwekere ebyokulya; habwokuba ekiro kinu kikuru kandi ky'ekitiinisa hali MUKAMA waitu; muleke kukwatwa obujune, habwokuba okusemererwa kwa MUKAMA nugo maani ganyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaleevi nukwo kuculeeza abantu boona nibagamba bati: “Muculeere, habwokuba ekiro kinu kikuru kandi ky'ekitiinisa; muleke kukwatwa obujune.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu boona baagenda kulya n'okunywa, kutweka ebyokulya n'okwegonza, habwokuba bakaba beetegeriize ebigambo ebi baarangiriirwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro ekyakurasireho, abakuru b'amaju aga baisenkuru b'abantu boona, hamu na baanyakatagara n'Abaleevi, bakagendera hamu omwa Ezira omuhandiiki, beege ebigambo by'Ebiragiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.33+LEV.23.34+LEV.23.35+LEV.23.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 23:33-36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.39+LEV.23.40+LEV.23.41+LEV.23.42+LEV.23.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "39-43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.13+DEU.16.14+DEU.16.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 16:13-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakasanga omu Biragiro MUKAMA ebi yaragiire Musa ebirukugamba ngu: Abaisirairi obu baraabaga omu bugenyi obw'okwezi kwa musanju, baraalege omu nsiisira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ngu bakimanyiseege kandi bakirangirrege omu mbuga zaabo zoona eza Yerusaalemu nibagamba bati: “Mugende omu nsozi, mwiheyo amataagi ag'emizaabbibbu, emizabbibbu enyakwemereze yonka, emikadasi, emikindo, n'emiti endi enyakugira ebikoora ey'okwombekesa ensiisira, nkooku kyahandiikirwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho abantu baagenda baagaleeta, baayeyombekera ensiisira, buli omu yayeyombekera orusiisira rwe wenka, omu mazigati gaabo, n'omu mazigati ag'enju ya Ruhanga, n'omu kizigati eky'irembo ery'amaizi, n'omu kizigati eky'irembo ery'Efuraimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitebe kyona eky'abo abakaba barugire omu bunyagwa, bakeeyombekera ensiisira, nizo baaraaramu; habwokuba okurugirra omu businge bwa Yeswa mutabani wa Nuuni, okuhika ha kiro eki, abantu ba Isirairi nukwo baakoraga. Hakabaho omuhimbo ogutagambwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli kiro, okuruga ha kiro eky'okubanza okuhika ha ky'okumalirra, yasomaga, ekitabu eky'Ebiragiro bya Ruhanga. Ekiro ekyobugenyi obu bakabusemeza okumara ebiro musanju; kandi ha kiro ekya munaana, hakabaho omukoro ogw'okumalirra, nkooku kiri omu Biragiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
